<section class="panel" id="start"><header><span class="kicker">Design</span><h1>{{.ID}}</h1><p>{{.Boundary}}</p></header>
<dl class="kv">{{if .Level}}<dt>Level</dt><dd>{{.Level}}</dd>{{end}}{{range .Sources}}<dt>Source</dt><dd id="{{.ID}}"><a class="ref" href="#{{.ID}}"><code>{{wbr .ID}}</code></a> {{.Text}}{{range .Fields}}{{if eq .Name "Pages"}}, pages {{.Value}}{{end}}{{end}}</dd>{{end}}<dt>Candidate</dt><dd>{{if .Candidate}}<code>{{wbr .Candidate}}</code>{{else}}{{gap "None selected"}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Context</dt><dd>{{if .Context}}<code>{{wbr .Context}}</code>{{else}}{{gap "None selected"}}{{end}}</dd><dt>Input files</dt><dd>{{range $i, $f := .Files}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}<code>{{wbr $f}}</code>{{end}}</dd></dl>
<section class="block" aria-labelledby="views-h"><h2 id="views-h">Choose a view</h2><p class="lede">Each view answers the questions of one reader. All views use the same model. The guide explains the terms and the labels.</p><div class="views">{{range .Tabs}}{{if ne .ID "start"}}<a class="view" href="#{{.ID}}"><span class="who">{{.Reader}}</span><h3>{{.Title}}</h3><p>{{.Question}}</p><p class="has">{{.Has}}</p></a>{{end}}{{end}}</div></section>
<section class="block" aria-labelledby="health-h"><h2 id="health-h">Design health</h2><p class="lede">The adhcl tool assessed the model. A page with zero errors is not proof that the design is valid.</p>
<div class="health"><div>{{tag (label "tool")}}<strong>{{.Health.Errors}}</strong>Errors<p>{{if .Health.Errors}}Fix the errors first. <a href="#findings">Open the list</a>.{{else}}The model is complete enough to assess.{{end}}</p></div><div>{{tag (label "tool")}}<strong>{{.Health.Warnings}}</strong>Warnings<p>{{if .Health.Warnings}}{{plural .Health.Kinds "kind" "kinds"}}. <a href="#findings">Open the list</a>.{{else}}The tool reported no warnings.{{end}}</p></div><div>{{if .Health.ExpectTotal}}{{tag (label "tool")}}<strong>{{.Health.ExpectHold}} / {{.Health.ExpectTotal}}</strong>Expectations hold<p>{{if eq .Health.ExpectHold .Health.ExpectTotal}}The assessed structure matches each expectation.{{else}}Some expectations fail. <a href="#expectations">See the expectations</a>.{{end}}</p>{{else}}{{tag (label "gap")}}<strong>0</strong>Expectations<p>The model states no expected classification.</p>{{end}}</div><div>{{if .Health.Evidence}}{{tag (label "source")}}{{else}}{{tag (label "gap")}}{{end}}<strong>{{.Health.Evidence}}</strong>Evidence records<p>{{if .Health.Evidence}}<a href="#r-evidence">See the evidence</a>.{{else}}No trial results support the selected design.{{end}}</p></div></div>
{{if .Summary}}<ul class="facts">{{range .Summary}}{{template "fact" .}}{{end}}</ul>{{end}}</section></section>
